# Git guesses "binary" by looking for a NUL byte in the first 8000 bytes.
# PDFs written by reportlab (DEMO_GUIDE.pdf) put their compressed streams far
# enough in that the guess misfires, and with core.autocrlf=true the file is
# then LF->CRLF converted on checkout, which corrupts it.  Declare the binary
# formats explicitly rather than relying on the heuristic.
*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.gif  binary
*.xlsx binary
